I've tried Radeon 9600 with the latest linuxppc_2_4_benh and
linuxppc-2.5-benh.

linuxppc_2_4_benh:

  With the recent change, radeon fbdev start recognizing 9600!  Thanks
  for benh.  After the kernel boot, it switch over to fbdev.  Screen
  has some noise.  Then I start X, a few seconds later, it stop
  working.  Screen is frozen.

linuxppc-2-5-benh

  After kernel boot, screen has some noise like linuxppc_2_4_benh.
  But X works like a charm.  There is no noise at all.  After quitting
  X, even on terminal the noise goes away...
